WEBVTT

00:01:00.555 --> 00:01:02.408
(Kahkahalar)

00:01:02.432 --> 00:01:07.471
(Beatboxing)

00:01:15.912 --> 00:01:17.825
NP: Pops,pops,pops,pops

00:01:17.849 --> 00:01:19.842
,durun durun durun!

00:01:19.866 --> 00:01:22.127
Aman Tanrım

00:01:22.151 --> 00:01:23.386
Tamam, benimle

00:01:23.386 --> 00:01:24.622
